  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Call Route",
    "overview": "An assured, experimental system built from one visible path. Editorial display type sets the pace, a bright route line marks the next move, and compact mono labels make the operating logic feel legible. The interface stays text-led, precise, and open rather than framing each idea in a card.\n\nLight and dark themes share the same hierarchy and accent logic. The surface changes between icy blue-white and midnight navy while the route signal remains vivid. Use motion sparingly to reveal sequence or confirm an interaction.",
